title Resolve and Read an Authorized File Batch - Target
participant Runtime
participant "File service" as API
database "File state" as DB
participant "Private object storage" as OBS
participant "Model input" as Model
Runtime -> API : Resolve ordered file IDs for Session
API -> DB : Lock and validate the complete batch
break Any file is invalid
  API -> DB : Roll back all reference changes
  API --> Runtime : Controlled batch error
end
API -> DB : Commit references and trusted snapshots
DB --> API : Committed metadata
API --> Runtime : Snapshots in request order
Runtime -> API : Read each file with expected digest
API -> DB : Recheck current reference, readiness and digest
API -> OBS : Stream bytes
