title Delete One Eligible File - Target
participant Client
participant "File service" as API
database "File state" as DB
participant "Delete worker" as Worker
participant "Private object storage" as OBS
Client -> API : Request file deletion
API -> API : Authorize Chat and resolve Session
API -> DB : Check eligibility; mark DELETING
DB --> API : Accepted or controlled rejection
break Deletion not eligible
  API --> Client : Controlled rejection; no delete work
end
API --> Client : Deletion receipt
Worker -> DB : Claim eligible DELETING lease
DB --> Worker : Committed identity and row version
Worker -> OBS : Idempotent delete outside transaction
alt Deleted or already absent
  OBS --> Worker : Success
  Worker -> DB : Remove detail;\nretain tombstone
else Temporary failure
  OBS --> Worker : Retryable error
  Worker -> DB : Release lease and schedule retry
end
note over API,DB
  Referenced files cannot use individual deletion.
  Object-key quarantine requires audited reconciliation.
end note
@enduml


