title Reconcile One Quarantined Object - Target
participant "Audited reconciler" as Worker
database "File state" as DB
participant "Private object storage" as OBS
Worker -> DB : Read stale or quarantined candidate
DB --> Worker : Identity and recorded metadata
Worker -> OBS : Inspect object metadata
OBS --> Worker : Object facts or NotFound
alt Ownership proven or object absent
  Worker -> DB : Conditionally recover state or confirm safe deletion
  DB --> Worker : Committed recovery or tombstone
else Ownership unknown
  Worker -> DB : Retain quarantine
  DB --> Worker : No deletion authorized
end
note over Worker,OBS
  Existence alone does not prove ownership.
  Ordinary cleanup cannot resolve object-key quarantine.
end note
@enduml
